From 3801fd45bd6280a5b320f2d464ada0bd04539326 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 00:00:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): add assigned ephemeral memory storage

Keep configured writable files in supervisor memory, with bounded data,
metadata and descriptors. Resolve paths component by component so image
links cannot bypass assignment precedence or hide invalid parents.

Cover storage isolation, copy protections, bounds and temporary native
path restoration while retaining existing unit and integration checks.

Apply resolved syscall and semantic rules before owned effects or path
rewriting, using the upstream contract catalog and bounded audit owner.
Register owned metadata ABIs without enabling unimplemented native calls.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
